            Shaklee Life Shake costs about $4.92 per 25 g of protein at the retail price of $110.25 for 28 servings, and about $4.18 per 25 g at the $93.65 member price, on Shaklee's US site on November 20, 2026. The math: 28 servings times 20 g of protein is 560 g, which is 22.4 portions of 25 g. Divide $110.25 by 22.4 and you get $4.92. The smaller 14-serving bags cost more per gram.
          </p>

          <p>
            For context, most of the powders in our <a href="/best-plant-based-protein-powder/">plant-based roundup</a> land between about $1.50 and $2.50 per 25 g, and a plain soy isolate can be under $1.00. Life Shake therefore costs two to five times as much per gram of protein as mainstream options. Part of that premium buys the fiber, vitamins and prebiotics a pure protein lacks, but even a meal shake like Garden of Life Raw Organic Meal comes in at about $1.84 per 25 g on Amazon.
          </p>

